SUMMARY:Legends of Rock: A Tribute to the 80's
DESCRIPTION:⚡Legends of Rock – A Tribute to the ‘80s are marking our FIRST-EVER appearance at the Brown County Playhouse\, and they’re bringing a full-throttle night of arena rock anthems that’ll have you singing\, cheering\, and pumping your fist from the first note to the last! 🤘 \nHear the biggest hits from: ⚡AC/DC | Bon Jovi | Def Leppard | Guns N’ Roses | Journey | Poison | Van Halen | & More! \nFrom soaring vocals and blistering guitar solos to massive sing-along choruses\, Legends of Rock recreates the music that defined the greatest decade in rock history! \nThrow on your favorite band tee\, gather your crew\, and get ready for a night of unforgettable rock ‘n’ roll! \n🤘 We’ll see you there… LET’S ROCK! 🎸🔥 \n \nBUY TICKETS\n \n\n\n\n\n 
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/legends-of-rock-a-tribute-to-the-80s-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:80s Music,Clasic Rock,Featured Event,Music,Pop Rock
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2026-LegendsOfRock_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
