SUMMARY:Sounds of Summer: Music of the Beach Boys
DESCRIPTION:Sounds of Summer is a tribute show featuring over 30 favorite hits and tells the story of America’s band – The Beach Boys. These four incredibly talented guys have known each other since grade school and shared a love of 1960’s music and Beach Boys’ harmonies. The band has been playing across the nation since 2015\, delivering audiences an authentic look and sound\, taking them back to memories of the 1960s. Surfs up! This show isn’t just fun…it’s fun\, fun\, fun! \nBUY TICKETS
